<title>USA: Wood Bancorp to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Wood Bancorp to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>BOWLING GREEN, Ohio 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wood Bancorp Inc said it plans to buy back up to 5-1/2 percent of its outstanding shares in the open market.</p>
<p>The shares will be purchased from time to time at prevailing market prices depending upon market conditions.</p>
<p>Wood said its board approved the repurchase program in view of the current price level of its common stock and the strong capital position of its First Federal Bank unit.</p>
<p>The repurchased shares will become treasury shares available for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
